<div class="modal fade credential-guide" id="credentialGuideModal" tabindex="-1"><div class="modal-dialog"><div class="modal-content"><div class="modal-header"><button class="close" data-dismiss="modal">&times;</button><h4 class="modal-title"><i class="fa fa-book"></i> 密钥填写教程</h4></div><div class="modal-body"><ul class="nav nav-tabs"><li class="active"><a href="#shoplineCredentialGuide" data-toggle="tab">Shopline</a></li><li><a href="#xshoppyCredentialGuide" data-toggle="tab">XShoppy</a></li></ul><div class="tab-content" style="padding-top:16px"><div class="tab-pane active" id="shoplineCredentialGuide"><div class="credential-guide-step"><h5>步骤 1：创建开发应用</h5><p>在 Shopline 后台左侧菜单点击<strong>「应用」→「开发应用」</strong>，再点击<strong>「创建应用」</strong>。应用名称可自定义；开发者选择自己，邮箱会自动填写。</p><div class="credential-guide-images"><a class="credential-guide-image" href="{{ asset('assets/erp/credential-guide/shopline-01-open-development-apps.png') }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="{{ asset('assets/erp/credential-guide/shopline-01-open-development-apps.png') }}" alt="Shopline 进入开发应用"></a><a class="credential-guide-image" href="{{ asset('assets/erp/credential-guide/shopline-02-create-app.png') }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="{{ asset('assets/erp/credential-guide/shopline-02-create-app.png') }}" alt="Shopline 创建应用"></a></div></div><div class="credential-guide-step"><h5>步骤 2：配置集成后台 API 权限</h5><p>进入刚创建的开发应用，在<strong>「权限配置」</strong>中找到<strong>「集成后台 API」</strong>，点击右侧<strong>「配置」</strong>；进入后勾选<strong>全选</strong>，然后点击右上角<strong>「保存」</strong>。</p><div class="credential-guide-images"><a class="credential-guide-image" href="{{ asset('assets/erp/credential-guide/shopline-03-open-api-config.png') }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="{{ asset('assets/erp/credential-guide/shopline-03-open-api-config.png') }}" alt="Shopline 配置后台 API"></a><a class="credential-guide-image" href="{{ asset('assets/erp/credential-guide/shopline-04-select-permissions.png') }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="{{ asset('assets/erp/credential-guide/shopline-04-select-permissions.png') }}" alt="Shopline 全选权限并保存"></a></div></div><div class="credential-guide-step"><h5>步骤 3：复制当前店铺的访问令牌</h5><p>进入开发应用的<strong>「API 凭据」</strong>，在<strong>「后台 API 访问令牌」</strong>区域点击<strong>「复制」</strong>，将令牌填写到本系统对应店铺的<strong>「Shopline Access Token」</strong>后保存。</p><div class="credential-guide-images single"><a class="credential-guide-image" href="{{ asset('assets/erp/credential-guide/shopline-05-copy-token.png') }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="{{ asset('assets/erp/credential-guide/shopline-05-copy-token.png') }}" alt="Shopline 复制后台 API 访问令牌"></a></div></div><div class="guide-note"><i class="fa fa-shield"></i> 令牌属于敏感信息；保存后系统不会展示明文，也不允许再次修改。</div></div><div class="tab-pane" id="xshoppyCredentialGuide"><div class="credential-guide-step"><h5>步骤 1：进入设置</h5><p>登录 XShoppy 后台，在左侧菜单栏点击<strong>「设置」</strong>，然后进入<strong>「基础信息」</strong>。</p><div class="credential-guide-images single"><a class="credential-guide-image" href="{{ asset('assets/erp/credential-guide/xshoppy-01-settings.png') }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="{{ asset('assets/erp/credential-guide/xshoppy-01-settings.png') }}" alt="XShoppy 设置与基础信息"></a></div></div><div class="credential-guide-step"><h5>步骤 2：找到 API 接口并填写凭据</h5><p>在<strong>「基础信息」</strong>页面向下滚动至底部，找到<strong>「API接口」</strong>。复制<strong>「API密钥」</strong>和<strong>「密码」</strong>，填写到本系统对应店铺后保存；<strong>共享密钥无需填写</strong>。</p><div class="credential-guide-images single"><a class="credential-guide-image" href="{{ asset('assets/erp/credential-guide/xshoppy-02-api-credentials.png') }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="{{ asset('assets/erp/credential-guide/xshoppy-02-api-credentials.png') }}" alt="XShoppy API 接口凭据"></a></div></div><div class="guide-note"><i class="fa fa-shield"></i> 凭据保存后不可再次编辑，请先确认店铺对应关系。</div></div></div></div><div class="modal-footer"><button class="btn btn-default" data-dismiss="modal">关闭</button></div></div></div></div>
